        {
          "title": "1. Read Feeds using Data Sync",
          "layout": "text",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Data Sync lets you read (and share) map markers and more.</li>\n<li>Feeds are like map layers: subscribe and then tick to see or disable them.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": []
        },
        {
          "title": "2. See What Feeds are Available",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Select Data Sync (arrows icon) on the toolbar</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/7079e1cb26097f5d.webp",
              "width": 853,
              "height": 348
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Subscribe to RECON Feed",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Select your TAK server (if you have many)</li>\n<li>Select the RECON feed</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/452827eba167ad9d.webp",
              "width": 348,
              "height": 135
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Download & Sync",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Select Download and stay synced</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/0f2754820054de57.webp",
              "width": 393,
              "height": 241
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Feed - Connected",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Check that the RECON feed indicator is green</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/f635a664a6b9fa68.webp",
