              "height": 237
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "There's More",
          "layout": "text",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Creating, sharing and subscribing to Feeds, e.g. for planning and executing a mission, is easy.</li>\n<li>We offer an out of the box setup for efficient data sharing for a military unit.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": []
        },
        {
